        "description": "<p>Adds Timeline Addons/Widgets that are specifically designed to be used in conjunction with the Elementor Page Builder.</p>\n<p>Video tutorial link:</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/51t-8qmhP6o?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<p>Video tutorial in Russian language</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1ZSO0Wu6A3I?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Please check on video tutorial.</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/51t-8qmhP6o?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n<p>Video tutorial in Russian language</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1ZSO0Wu6A3I?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.6.3 &#8211; 10 December 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added helpful timeline plugin recommendations to make it easier for users to discover related features.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.6.2 &#8211; 02 December 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed an issue where the timeline was not visible on the front end.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.6.1 &#8211; 27 November 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Transferred plugin ownership to <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/satindersingh/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Satinder Singh</a> (Co-founder, <a href=\"https://coolplugins.net\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Cool Plugins</a>).</li>\n<li>Refreshed plugin icon and banner assets for a modern and consistent visual identity.</li>\n<li>Implemented several code optimizations to improve stability and maintainability.</li>\n<li>Renamed plugin to &#8220;Vertical Timeline Widget for Elementor&#8221; for better clarity and branding.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.5 &#8211; 14 July 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed the Licensing/Trademark violation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.4 &#8211; 04 May 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed Elementor deprecated functions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.3 &#8211; 21 March 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed the &#8220;notice&#8221; folder due to vulnerability-related issues.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.2 &#8211; 17 March 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added heading tag option for the title.</li>\n<li>Rechecked vulnerability (CVSS: 5.4).</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.1 &#8211; 10 December 2023</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed medium-severity vulnerability (CVE-2023-49755).</li>\n<li>Vulnerability Type: Broken Access Control (CVSS: 5.4)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0 &#8211; 02 January 2023</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested with WordPress 6.11.</li>\n<li>Tested with Elementor 3.9.2.</li>\n<li>Fixed several bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.9 &#8211; 31 August 2022</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested with the latest WordPress version.</li>\n<li>Tested with the latest Elementor version.</li>\n<li>Fixed some bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.8 &#8211; 24 April 2022</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Checked compatibility with WordPress 5.9.</li>\n<li>Checked compatibility with Elementor 3.6.4.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.6 &#8211; 08 September 2021</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed front-end editing bug.</li>\n<li>Fixed Elementor deprecated function warnings.</li>\n<li>Checked compatibility with WordPress 5.8.</li>\n<li>Checked compatibility with Elementor 3.4.3.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.5 &#8211; 17 September 2020</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3 &#8211; 16 September 2020</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added box direction.</li>\n<li>Organized widget controls.</li>\n<li>Fixed bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2 &#8211; 16 January 2019</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added image option and image style tab.</li>\n<li>Added box style options.</li>\n<li>Enabled content updates without page refresh.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Style tab.</li>\n<li>Added title color, typography, and timeline color options.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0 &#8211; 21 October 2018</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Use a vertical timeline widget for Elementor to showcase your journey, story, milestones or roadmap in a clean Elementor timeline layout.",
